# Line endings: store and check out every text file with LF, on Windows too.
# Without this, each person's git settings decide, and files flip between CRLF and LF,
# which shows up as "every line changed" diffs and breaks tests that read test-data logs.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch line endings in binary files.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
